+## Pipeline stages and queue (migration `20261025000600`)
+
+- Renames the queued stages in the `pipeline_events` and `pipeline_dead_letters`
+  CHECKs to the pipeline registry's (`storage.event` → `object-landed`,
+  `index.upsert` → `session-indexed`, `transform` → `file-normalize`) and adds
+  `summary-short`, `summary-long`, `status-classify`, `file-maintenance`. Existing
+  rows are renamed too, dead letter ids and messages included.
+- `sessions.pipeline_jobs`: the Postgres `PipelineQueue` backend for deployments
+  without Cloudflare Queues. Claimed with `FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED` under a lease,
+  index `(stage, visible_at, id)`; exhausted jobs are quarantined into
+  `pipeline_dead_letters`. Service-role only, like the other pipeline tables.
+  Messages carry ids and object keys, never session content.
+
+Tests: `tests/pipeline_queue_test.sql` (the concurrent claim runs when `dblink`
+is installed) and `packages/relayhistory/test/pipeline-queue.test.ts`.
+
